## 1. Executive Summary

This document provides the fully diluted capitalization table for MedSync Health following the close of the Series D financing round in June 2024. The table details the ownership breakdown across all investor classes, the employee stock option pool (ESOP), and the founders/common shareholders.

The Series D round successfully raised **AED 551,250,000**, bringing the total capital raised to date to **AED 992,250,000**. The post-money valuation for the Series D round was established at **AED 5,512,500,000**.

